[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5821.59, "timestamp": "01:37:01", "text": "安い方がいい、だって私は欲しいし、欲しくないから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5823.99, "timestamp": "01:37:03", "text": "将来的にはそれを増やすような。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5826.31, "timestamp": "01:37:06", "text": "今ここであなたに約束します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5829.43, "timestamp": "01:37:09", "text": "私が企業に入社するまで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5831.03, "timestamp": "01:37:11", "text": "何かがあって、彼らは私に要求する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5842.47, "timestamp": "01:37:22", "text": "けれど。ビジネス上の動きも加えるべきかもしれません。何が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5845.59, "timestamp": "01:37:25", "text": "もしかして？あなたは私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5849.43, "timestamp": "01:37:29", "text": "数学すらできない人がビジネスができるのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5851.99, "timestamp": "01:37:31", "text": "それは衝動的だ。私は自分自身を見たい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5854.35, "timestamp": "01:37:34", "text": "ビジネスを行う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5856.51, "timestamp": "01:37:36", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5859.446, "timestamp": "01:37:39", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "\"for others who cant afford it\" mr nix, what golden world are ye living in"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5860.189, "timestamp": "01:37:40", "text": "私が自分自身を列挙している方法は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5863.59, "timestamp": "01:37:43", "text": "非常識な。でも、正直言ってそうは思わない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5871.83, "timestamp": "01:37:51", "text": "男。余裕のない方のために、ミスター。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5872.755, "timestamp": "01:37:52", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ah, sry, *bad business move"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5873.51, "timestamp": "01:37:53", "text": "ネックス、君はどんな黄金の世界に住んでいるんだ？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5875.91, "timestamp": "01:37:55", "text": "で？どういう意味ですか？つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5877.87, "timestamp": "01:37:57", "text": "ほら、まるで"}]